Asset Packs Used
-----------------

1. Fantasy Town Kit v2.0 (2025-08-03)
   https://kenney.nl/assets/fantasy-town-kit
   160 models - medieval buildings, walls, roofs, trees, fences, props
   Files in: static/models/village/

2. Graveyard Kit v5.0 (2025-10-17)
   https://kenney.nl/assets/graveyard-kit
   90 models + animations - gravestones, fences, trees, crypts, characters
   Files in: static/models/graveyard/

3. Blocky Characters v2.0 (2025-06-10)
   https://kenney.nl/assets/blocky-characters
   20 models + animations - character models (a through r)
   Files in: static/models/characters/


